WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.765
The asteroid we moved.

00:02.465 --> 00:04.311
Didymos has a small moon.

00:04.761 --> 00:13.874
In 2022 a spacecraft called DART was flown straight into that moon at more than six kilometres a second, on purpose.

00:14.324 --> 00:17.370
Its orbit became thirty-two minutes shorter.

00:17.820 --> 00:22.227
It was the first time people changed the motion of anything in the sky.
